    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0010",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s01-p160-06562-s007",
      "sentenceText": "What about parenting when your child graduates from high school?",
      "sentenceSha256": "2847ea6a9500cc5213e8808cf24e270171de22f45fe871f1247db6cb7cf0f9a5",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s01-p160-06562-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-004",
      "parentFingerprint": "d5a8f9d93b7e14fb4b3cccfbc490765284e8f9c1ea5b42c852b64f59e4ec589d",
      "passageSha256": "e63dc8301182e6905dc26c0247ef4ad015f3036810945a388d4203e0e07bd569",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0011",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In 1890, William James invented the self-esteem equation in The Principles of Psychology, which is written as follows: “self-esteem = success/pretentions.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "a46412e29adff56e519312972f030faded9c3a3c46ead6078d9065b8b5372ce6",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "e882f0664d9d689ecf0a3bb2ee826dd0c8453068e22e92d8c9e601a6088e1a52",
      "passageSha256": "b14b6e5eb9f7c204d4736bff7bbcecd180140cd2685820d639c6f9df74e4892c",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0012",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-s003",
      "sentenceText": "So, self-esteem is high if one has fulfilled most of their aspirations, and low if they haven’t.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0426c60e0b007e5133a59f5ed5c7d88a42bf9eb39fe12e63288c9ee513063de6",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "e882f0664d9d689ecf0a3bb2ee826dd0c8453068e22e92d8c9e601a6088e1a52",
      "passageSha256": "b14b6e5eb9f7c204d4736bff7bbcecd180140cd2685820d639c6f9df74e4892c",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0013",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-s004",
      "sentenceText": "According to this formula, there are two ways to increase self-esteem.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eafd8bd2701c35f7c5a3a1ff2420f42257538e59fad1a593096fdd97ce269dc7",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "e882f0664d9d689ecf0a3bb2ee826dd0c8453068e22e92d8c9e601a6088e1a52",
      "passageSha256": "b14b6e5eb9f7c204d4736bff7bbcecd180140cd2685820d639c6f9df74e4892c",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0014",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-s007",
      "sentenceText": "James’s self-esteem equation could be applied to happiness as well.",
      "sentenceSha256": "25cfefe5be0cd87c0c08903e9dbad200c244dd47636280d696441efb846565bf",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "d4653b02375a92b5b158ab11fb507c815dd2cc3c6cf82a052b3439e80f4520c4",
      "passageSha256": "ec0783f74ca15ac0749534afa2b368fe7f529f5eb05b08a2c23923814a3be585",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0015",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-s009",
      "sentenceText": "One could increase happiness by increasing success or by reducing aspirations.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3a57f81eca1c97421c13106aa7a0a5987fff1242528ad6efe990cee4571b8700",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-02625-r009-010",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "bd5cfd0c7813ec2f9a90d38ea254d66a98cf25f8e5eec1fa6c416bd9116bfb08",
      "passageSha256": "a70391f4625f7c7b9bc3df5e8b072c5ddd695768aa5f0f9a5d43bf07a856d389",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0016",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-s001",
      "sentenceText": "That being said, what kinds of success are we talking about?",
      "sentenceSha256": "c4fd5e4a045eedcd4b290ab8540f3e2c0a633fcbba1d0590ea191d9177f6d7a1",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-008",
      "parentFingerprint": "135db360468f81738342bdbfb527f9c2469d06e55ed7fb7e5d6f0e4261db94a8",
      "passageSha256": "15e7553ad430cfeccd93f8e1382f3d04ae61ac210bdac1abf3961932872da60e",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0017",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-s003",
      "sentenceText": "If you are successful in work and love, you have likely succeeded in life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7db113796a887f29d31b4eb7590922290212e1c53e18e94c7473a52758f22216",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-008",
      "parentFingerprint": "135db360468f81738342bdbfb527f9c2469d06e55ed7fb7e5d6f0e4261db94a8",
      "passageSha256": "15e7553ad430cfeccd93f8e1382f3d04ae61ac210bdac1abf3961932872da60e",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0018",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Those who say they are satisfied with their jobs are those who are succeeding.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ccfdb36e8f78e515c0ff7ad47341e167f674210bb7a3884dc33a41ff106ade7a",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "be5e60eafaef53b66d36b8149f52ffb6e6ef416f64881220bb046b425b176efa",
      "passageSha256": "5c184d5a6211f5566c1ef6f9280a15e700c39b2e49330942fe14ee2d1ccef654",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0019",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-s008",
      "sentenceText": "According to this data, what predicts job satisfaction?",
      "sentenceSha256": "f980bba3d48b55032592a648828574e8e84c225672e35320dc9c964711d6183c",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p161-05160-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "be5e60eafaef53b66d36b8149f52ffb6e6ef416f64881220bb046b425b176efa",
      "passageSha256": "5c184d5a6211f5566c1ef6f9280a15e700c39b2e49330942fe14ee2d1ccef654",
      "pdfPages": [
        161
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0020",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Similarly, 78 percent of computer and information scientists are satisfied with their jobs.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c25957f07cb8d1b251c2ef47ae848a6b7708a3e1f69bb0f3a04da521ba9251e6",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "b232162642e5a75fcfdf78969b0fadccdc6daadfea6945834c97532c1ae2279c",
      "passageSha256": "ac1f19f11a32c6988d7ab7b7e64c5db7e10d0ee17021a3d9810c7866cee52c5c",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0021",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In contrast, only 65 percent of police officers are satisfied with their jobs.",
      "sentenceSha256": "45d348adf4fb6ae1082a7482c604e34ff76834620e9fd34498e5b2e658b99751",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "b232162642e5a75fcfdf78969b0fadccdc6daadfea6945834c97532c1ae2279c",
      "passageSha256": "ac1f19f11a32c6988d7ab7b7e64c5db7e10d0ee17021a3d9810c7866cee52c5c",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0022",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Why are actuaries and computer scientists more satisfied at work than social workers and police officers?",
      "sentenceSha256": "28954db0490b45f83aa07734957b86fcfb1701a58394ac15879d06628b565a89",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-012",
      "parentFingerprint": "d232c5149eb8ea932a7effb508ecb5b08d0d0b88b66276f767f434ad4188883f",
      "passageSha256": "2b093a0da5c5b0b207fd7ff80cd8e79bb975bee98a99912d89179c572e3d2f72",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0023",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Given the difficult jobs that social workers and police officers do every day, their pay is not that great.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7a31f3ca1c89e39076ab73d410e64831295a731882f99bc3c231f342aa4f95dc",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-00750-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-012",
      "parentFingerprint": "d232c5149eb8ea932a7effb508ecb5b08d0d0b88b66276f767f434ad4188883f",
      "passageSha256": "2b093a0da5c5b0b207fd7ff80cd8e79bb975bee98a99912d89179c572e3d2f72",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-s002",
      "sentenceText": "What about meaning in one’s job?",
      "sentenceSha256": "f44789c65fd4c78a4cf3e8bfa11b7fa1bf5282ee5f1331546ed72e3ce2a97637",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-014",
      "parentFingerprint": "4e662e17e1dc67efe28030a24f54fe344560e984d1f8a03032c7fa181543a52d",
      "passageSha256": "0a711e167d1bea1276ccc2107b9dd92ed9d209a1567ab7d882400f08ca1fe094",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Interestingly, Payscale measured this.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a9049caf7e0d3dc414e8532f2f87e0c1bf008eb10d34b6b97cb553403afb4c48",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-014",
      "parentFingerprint": "4e662e17e1dc67efe28030a24f54fe344560e984d1f8a03032c7fa181543a52d",
      "passageSha256": "0a711e167d1bea1276ccc2107b9dd92ed9d209a1567ab7d882400f08ca1fe094",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-s005",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, only 36 percent of actuaries find meaning in their jobs, and only 45 percent of computer and information scientists do.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5e89bf2355c3fa4618db9aae5257824f35114a2e6e592bb78506132e8e17140f",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "c6b462763acdd06f8f99f2ac83b04dd8a5d5275af3dd2822603fc960a6590678",
      "passageSha256": "ba9062285a747ac9255e5c91b76334feb4c0f24541bf5922c09d08047eb5ffe7",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-s006",
      "sentenceText": "In contrast, although social workers and police officers are not super satisfied with their jobs, they find them to be meaningful.",
      "sentenceSha256": "445870403ec826b8ce8273af63d9992aef7837fdba89763de83e6f9e2b173fff",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-02700-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "c6b462763acdd06f8f99f2ac83b04dd8a5d5275af3dd2822603fc960a6590678",
      "passageSha256": "ba9062285a747ac9255e5c91b76334feb4c0f24541bf5922c09d08047eb5ffe7",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Are there good jobs that are not high in job satisfaction or meaning, though?",
      "sentenceSha256": "cd4ddc742afadfd053f813b08f41e48a234293ae806ca487bf59a8d05fc74299",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "9c175fcf66ab4456a5dc4464c62195704b8ef57527c17219748ae76e051a2c86",
      "passageSha256": "75542b8d5f56c44a07776a44d62ef732d71024f2cd58ca952754702c93218c1f",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The Payscale data show an interesting pattern.",
      "sentenceSha256": "877819473c2209435c0256bf5ea60a8217a70c5a4e8d2807fd58753c163b43d4",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "9c175fcf66ab4456a5dc4464c62195704b8ef57527c17219748ae76e051a2c86",
      "passageSha256": "75542b8d5f56c44a07776a44d62ef732d71024f2cd58ca952754702c93218c1f",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-s003",
      "sentenceText": "While 65 percent of editors find their jobs to be satisfying, only 42 percent find them meaningful.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2e46d6554122d7e75e682790b87d30ee13989fe3d4020a8c7f5a3faf575f71d8",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "9c175fcf66ab4456a5dc4464c62195704b8ef57527c17219748ae76e051a2c86",
      "passageSha256": "75542b8d5f56c44a07776a44d62ef732d71024f2cd58ca952754702c93218c1f",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Funeral directors are an interesting comparison group.",
      "sentenceSha256": "02186524e1863cd1853fb42e917403c38e8c9e5ded641f58e4efdfa62b9dda17",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-04650-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "402bbbe894908d9a00d12a1ab460baa5056b0e60d8aa135bf7994a4b60e9ebfb",
      "passageSha256": "4eb998ae56c0038e73988be5be21168637cbd8acda802f8bbc6dd5df9cc8a5ce",
      "pdfPages": [
        162
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-06405-s001",
      "sentenceText": "If satisfaction and meaning were the only metrics of good jobs, then we might tell art directors, editors, and writers to consider becoming funeral directors.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4c4909b95c9fbf6e5433d9e8b9f5a4db75cac83a272b2b7d1058114cf7968509",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-06405-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "993065ab939a3024813d45b51716425223edc64b8b5bbb8c38e05bd31e9cda0c",
      "passageSha256": "647b9c49188aa655a404a53e319451cb32e71870a27fdcccc30d9b48d0cbd53e",
      "pdfPages": [
        162,
        163
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s02-p162-06405-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Realistically, we wouldn’t, because we know that editors, art directors, and writers have something that funeral directors don’t have: self- expression and creativity.",
      "sentenceSha256": "aed66298854e04dafe9924f7b0f737794f4efee6ec1198dd306776b9b93310fc",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s02-p162-06405-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "993065ab939a3024813d45b51716425223edc64b8b5bbb8c38e05bd31e9cda0c",
